    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d747-a2">

                <pb facs="0868" n="772" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg772"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Straus to His
                        Excellency Tewfik Pasha.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-09-02"><hi rendition="#italic">September 2,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: On the 24th of August I addressed a
                    note to Your Excellency that I had on the 16th of August received instructions
                    from my Government that the President of the United States desired that I have
                    an audience with His Imperial Majesty the Sultan to convey in person to His
                    Imperial Majesty an important communication from the President.</p>
                <p>I deem it my duty to remind Your Excellency that I have not received a reply to
                    my note.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Oscar S. Straus.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
